feature: fix-strategy-engine-bugs
description: |
  Fix 2 bugs in Strategy Engine:
  1. StrategyController does not use IJobQueue to enqueue backtest jobs, and uses a local RxJS EventBusService instead of the shared IEventBus.
  2. DELETE /api/strategies/:name is undocumented in kb/contracts/strategy.yaml.
